        "mi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I tatari tonu tētahi hokonga o mua US$%lld kia whakamahia, nā reira i whakaotihia tērā i te utu anō i a koe. Hoki ki Safari ka whakatuwhera i te matapihi pakū DisinfaX ki te tirotiro i tō toenga hou."
