    "By topping up, you agree to our [Terms of Service](https://disinfax.app/terms-of-use) and [Privacy Policy](https://disinfax.app/privacy-policy). Foreign exchange fees may apply if you pay in a currency other than USD." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deur op te laai, stem jy in tot ons [Diensvoorwaardes](https://disinfax.app/terms-of-use) en [Privaatheidsbeleid](https://disinfax.app/privacy-policy). Wisselkoersfooie kan van toepassing wees as jy in 'n ander geldeenheid as USD betaal."
          }
        },
        "ak" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sɛ wode sika tɔ mu a, wopene [Adwuma ho Mmara](https://disinfax.app/terms-of-use) ne [Kokoamsɛm ho Nhyehyɛe](https://disinfax.app/privacy-policy) a yɛwɔ so. Sɛ wode sika a ɛnyɛ USD tua ka a, wɔbɛtumi de sika sesa ka aka ho."
          }
        },
        "am" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "በመሙላት፣ የእኛን [የአገልግሎት ውሎች](https://disinfax.app/terms-of-use) እና [የግላዊነት መርህ](https://disinfax.app/privacy-policy) ተቀብለዋል። ከ USD ውጪ በሌላ ምንዛሪ የሚከፍሉ ከሆነ የውጭ ምንዛሪ ልውውጥ ክፍያዎች ሊተከሉ ይችላሉ።"
          }
        },
        "an" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Recargando, acceptas os nuestros [Termins de Servicio](https://disinfax.app/terms-of-use) e a nuestra [Politica de Privacidat](https://disinfax.app/privacy-policy). Se pueden aplicar comisions de cambio de moneda si pagas en una moneda distinta a l'USD."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "بالشحن، فإنك توافق على [شروط الخدمة](https://disinfax.app/terms-of-use) و[سياسة الخصوصية](https://disinfax.app/privacy-policy) الخاصة بنا. قد تُطبَّق رسوم صرف عملات إذا دفعت بعملة غير الدولار الأمريكي."
          }
        },
        "as" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "টপ আপ কৰাৰ দ্বাৰা, আপুনি আমাৰ [সেৱাৰ চৰ্তসমূহ](https://disinfax.app/terms-of-use) আৰু [গোপনীয়তা নীতি](https://disinfax.app/privacy-policy) ৰ সৈতে সন্মত হয়। যদি আপুনি USD ৰ বাহিৰে অন্য মুদ্ৰাত পৰিশোধ কৰে, বৈদেশিক মুদ্ৰা বিনিময় মাচুল প্ৰযোজ্য হ'ব পাৰে।"
          }
        },
        "ast" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Al recargar, aceutes los nuesos [Términos de Serviciu](https://disinfax.app/terms-of-use) y la nuesa [Política de Privacidá](https://disinfax.app/privacy-policy). Puen aplicase comisiones de cambéu de moneda si pagues nuna moneda distinta al USD."
          }
        },
        "az" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Doldurmaqla siz [Xidmət Şərtlərimizi](https://disinfax.app/terms-of-use) və [Məxfilik Siyasətimizi](https://disinfax.app/privacy-policy) qəbul edirsiniz. USD-dən başqa valyutada ödəniş etsəniz, valyuta məzənnəsi haqları tətbiq oluna bilər."
          }
        },
        "be" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Папаўняючы рахунак, вы згаджаецеся з нашымі [Умовамі абслугоўвання](https://disinfax.app/terms-of-use) і [Палітыкай канфідэнцыйнасці](https://disinfax.app/privacy-policy). Пры аплаце не ў USD можа спаганяцца камісія за канвертацыю валюты."
          }
        },
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Със зареждането приемате нашите [Условия за ползване](https://disinfax.app/terms-of-use) и нашата [Политика за поверителност](https://disinfax.app/privacy-policy). Могат да се начислят такси за обмен на валута, ако плащате в различна от USD валута."
          }
        },
        "bn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "টপ আপ করার মাধ্যমে, আপনি আমাদের [পরিষেবার শর্তাবলী](https://disinfax.app/terms-of-use) এবং [গোপনীয়তা নীতি](https://disinfax.app/privacy-policy)-তে সম্মত হচ্ছেন। USD ছাড়া অন্য মুদ্রায় অর্থ প্রদান করলে বৈদেশিক মুদ্রা বিনিময় ফি প্রযোজ্য হতে পারে।"
          }
        },
        "br" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dre gargañ, emaoc'h asantus d'hor [Divizoù ar Servij](https://disinfax.app/terms-of-use) ha d'hor [Politikerezh Prevezded](https://disinfax.app/privacy-policy). Feurmoù eskemm moneiz a c'hallfe bezañ arloet ma paeit gant ur moneiz all eget an USD."
          }
        },
        "bs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nadopunom prihvaćate naše [Uvjete korištenja](https://disinfax.app/terms-of-use) i našu [Politiku privatnosti](https://disinfax.app/privacy-policy). Mogu se naplatiti naknade za konverziju valute ako plaćate u valuti različitoj od USD."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En recarregar, acceptes les nostres [Condicions del servei](https://disinfax.app/terms-of-use) i la nostra [Política de privacitat](https://disinfax.app/privacy-policy). Poden aplicar-se comissions de canvi de divisa si pagues en una divisa diferent de l'USD."
