        },
        "tn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O na le go tlatsa ga US$%lld go setse go emetse go dirisiwa — ga o a lefisiwa gape. Boela kwa Safari mme o bule window e tswang ya DisinfaX go go dirisa mo palanseng ya gago."
