        },
        "to" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kuo ke maʻu ha fakafonu ʻo e US$%lld ʻoku tatali ke ngāueʻaki — naʻe ʻikai ke toe totongi koe. Foki ki Safari pea fakaava e matapā puna ʻa DisinfaX ke ngāueʻaki ia ki hoʻo tukui totongi."
